# Node.js Rules (NestJS 10 + TypeScript)

## 🏗️ Structure (NestJS Module)
```
modules/{feature}/
├── {feature}.module.ts
├── {feature}.controller.ts
├── {feature}.service.ts
├── {feature}.repository.ts
├── entities/
├── dto/
├── guards/
├── interceptors/
└── *.spec.ts
```

## 📐 Naming
- Class: PascalCase + suffix (Module/Controller/Service/Repository)
- Method/Variable: camelCase
- Constant: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
- File: kebab-case hoặc dot.notation
- DTO: PascalCase + Dto
- Interface: PascalCase, NO `I` prefix

## ✅ MUST
- Use class-validator cho DTO validation
- Use Swagger decorators (@ApiTags, @ApiOperation, @ApiResponse)
- Use @CurrentUser() decorator thay vì đọc từ request
- Use class-based exception filters
- Use WebSocket gateway namespaced (/exam, /proctoring)
- Async/await (NO callback hell)
- Use KafkaJS hoặc kafkajs cho Kafka
- Use TypeORM hoặc Prisma cho DB
- Use Jest + Supertest cho test

## ❌ NEVER
- `any` type (dùng `unknown` + type guards)
- `console.log` (dùng Logger từ @nestjs/common)
- Magic numbers
- Hardcoded secrets, URLs
- File `.js` (chỉ `.ts`)
- var (chỉ const/let)
- Empty catch block
- Comment lặp lại code
- Business logic trong Controller

## 🧪 Test
- Jest + Supertest
- Test files: `*.spec.ts` (unit), `*.e2e-spec.ts` (e2e)
- Mock với `jest.Mocked<T>`
- Use Test.createTestingModule
- Coverage ≥ 80%

